&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Epirus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epirus is a high-growth technology company dedicated to overcoming the asymmetric challenges inherent to the future of national security. Epirus&#39; flagship product, Leonidas, is a software-defined system built using intelligent power management techniques which allow power-hungry systems to do more with less.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;This is an exciting opportunity at an innovative, high-growth defense technology company. As a Senior Procurement Agent (Contract), you will lead the sourcing and procurement of Electrical, Electronic, and Electromechanical (EEE) components, as well as complex PCB and PCBA solutions, supporting multiple programs from prototype through production. In this role, you will manage the full lifecycle of procurement for printed circuit boards and assemblies, including both turnkey builds and discrete &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt; sourcing. You will work closely with engineering and manufacturing teams to support new product introduction (NPI) efforts, ensuring that Bills of Materials (BOMs) are strategically sourced, cost-effective, and aligned with program timelines. The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;ideal candidate brings deep experience navigating the complexities of electronics supply chains, including contract manufacturers, global component distribution, and risk mitigation for constrained or obsolete parts.. If you are someone who enjoys launching new products, influencing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;selection, strategically&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;sourcing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51892070 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and developing suppliers and owning a project from cradle-to-grave, then this is the role for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
