&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Field Service Representative III (FSR III)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a senior-level technician providing advanced technical, operational, and training support for Epirus HPM-CUAS systems. FSR IIIs act as the technical lead during field operations and deployments, conduct detailed system diagnostics, and interface directly with program offices and engineering teams. This position combines hands-on&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;with leadership, mentorship, and customer-facing responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
