&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Epirus&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Epirus is a high-growth technology company dedicated to overcoming the asymmetric challenges inherent to the future of national security. Epirus&#39; flagship product, Leonidas, is a software-defined system built using intelligent power management techniques which allow power-hungry systems to do more with less.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Epirus, we’re always looking ahead—and that includes building relationships with forward-thinking engineers who want to shape the future of defense technology. While we may not have an immediate opening that matches your background, we invite you to express interest in future Electrical Engineering opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
