&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience working as a technician or working experience in the aerospace or defense manufacturing field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with electro-mechanical assembly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soldering certification and experience soldering cables and harnesses (circuit boards come pre-assembled)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with standard manufacturing equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aerospace/Defense experience and/or military experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Epirus, you’ll work with technical peers and great people—and get first crack at some of the defining technology challenges of our time. Here, “impossible” is just a challenge. We&#39;re a diverse, fast-growing team of change-makers fueling the future of energy with revolutionary solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.epirusinc.com/open-roles&quot;&gt;Join us and rewrite the rules.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Epirus is a high-growth technology company dedicated to overcoming the asymmetric challenges inherent to the future of national security. Epirus&#39; flagship product, Leonidas, is a software-defined system built using intelligent power management techniques which allow power-hungry systems to do more with less.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Epirus, we’re always looking ahead—and that includes building relationships with forward-thinking engineers who want to shape the future of defense technology. While we may not have an immediate opening that matches your background, we invite you to express interest in future&amp;nbsp;Warehouse Associate opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**This posting is for resume collection in anticipation of future opportunities. A member of our Talent Acquisition team will contact you if a suitable position becomes available.**&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
